{{define "subject"}}
Rental ending soon: {{.ItemTitle}}
{{end}}

{{define "plainBody"}}
Hello,

This is a reminder that your rental of "{{.ItemTitle}}" will end at:

{{.EndAt | formatTime}}

Please make sure to return the item on time to avoid additional charges.

Thank you for using our service.
{{end}}

{{define "htmlBody"}}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Rental ending soon</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333;">
    <h2>Rental ending soon</h2>
    <p>This is a reminder that your rental of <strong>{{.ItemTitle}}</strong> will end at:</p>
    <p style="font-size: 16px;"><strong>{{.EndAt | formatTime}}</strong></p>
    <p>Please make sure to return the item on time to avoid additional charges.</p>
    <hr>
    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #777;">This is an automated message. Please do not reply.</p>
</body>
</html>
{{end}}
